FAIL F1 — Required demo Cloud Storage is not a subscription.
Criterion: task-1-brief.md first checkbox (Cloud Storage true), approved design
Shared accuracy rules / Subscription classification, lines 92-94.
Exact lead-supplied bank strings, instantiated as synthetic transactions:
Description='Cloud Storage'; OriginalDescription='CLOUDBOX*STORAGE PLAN CLOUDBOX.COM CA';
Category='Electronics & Software'. Three monthly $25 outflows are detected as
merchant 'cloud storage', AnnualCost=300, Classification='other'.
classification.go:20-26 exclusively selects the nonempty OriginalDescription;
the recognized phrase 'cloud storage' is absent from that bank string and the
category is not subscription-specific. The friendly-description-only positive
fixture classification_test.go:15,24 does not exercise this path.

FAIL F2 — Required auto-loan bill is classified as other.
Criterion: approved design Shared accuracy rules / Subscription classification,
lines 93-94: loans belong to recurring bills; DI1 shared three-way classifier.
Description='AutoLoan Finance'; OriginalDescription='AUTOLOAN FINANCE BILL PMT';
Category='Auto Payment'. Three monthly $25 outflows are detected as merchant
'autoloan finance', AnnualCost=300, Classification='other'.
classification.go:30,35 recognizes neither 'Auto Payment' nor the bank's
'AUTOLOAN' token. 'auto loan' requires a word boundary between the words.
The brief's non-subscription assertion alone cannot distinguish a bill from other.

Executable reproduction (copy only; fixture files retained for lead inspection):
